{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"Sunan Abû Dâwûd","section":{"19":"Shares of Inheritance (Kitab Al-Fara'id)"},"section_detail":{"19":{"hadithnumber_first":2885,"hadithnumber_last":2927,"arabicnumber_first":2885,"arabicnumber_last":2927,"name_native":"Livre des successions (Fara'id)"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2912,"arabicnumber":2912,"text":"Rapporté par Mu‘adh ibn Jabal : J’ai entendu le Messager d’Allah ﷺ dire : « L’islam augmente et ne diminue pas. » Il a donc désigné un musulman comme héritier d’un non-musulman","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":19,"hadith":28}}]}